{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q421637","formula":"C₂₅H₃₂ClFO₅","hill":"C25H32ClFO5","elements":["H","C","O","F","Cl"],"composition":{"C":25.0,"F":1.0,"H":32.0,"O":5.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Clobetasol propionate","ru":"Клобетазол пропионат"},"descriptions":{"en":"Clobetasol propionate is a corticosteroid that is used to treat skin conditions such as eczema, contact dermatitis, seborrheic dermatitis, steroid responsive dermatosis, and psoriasis (including scalp and plaque-type). It is applied to the skin as a cream, foam, gel, liquid, solution, ointment, or shampoo. Clobetasol propionate is a propionate ester of the corticosteroid clobetasol.","ru":"Клобетазол пропионат — кортикостероид, используемый для лечения кожных заболеваний, таких как экзема, контактный дерматит, себорейный дерматит и псориаз. Препарат наносят на кожу в виде крема, мази или шампуня. Применение должно быть кратковременным и только в том случае, если другие, более слабые кортикостероиды неэффективны."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":32798,"mass":467.0,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCC(=O)O[C@@]1([C@H](C[C@@H]2[C@@]1(C[C@@H]([C@]3([C@H]2CCC4=CC(=O)C=C[C@@]43C)F)O)C)C)C(=O)CCl","inchikey":"CBGUOGMQLZIXBE-XGQKBEPLSA-N","iupac":"[(8S,9R,10S,11S,13S,14S,16S,17R)-17-(2-chloroacetyl)-9-fluoro-11-hydroxy-10,13,16-trimethyl-3-oxo-6,7,8,11,12,14,15,16-octahydrocyclopenta[a]phenanthren-17-yl] propanoate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"32798","atoms":64,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.199,"y":1.011,"z":2.649,"el":"Cl"},{"x":1.771,"y":-1.125,"z":0.337,"el":"F"},{"x":-2.619,"y":-1.061,"z":0.231,"el":"O"},{"x":1.19,"y":2.123,"z":1.763,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.59,"y":1.439,"z":-0.221,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.741,"y":-1.232,"z":-0.659,"el":"O"},{"x":6.531,"y":-2.187,"z":0.443,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.111,"y":0.866,"z":0.067,"el